                "Reporting because a player in this server sent content in the chat that encouraged self-harm directed at an identifiable individual. This content can cause real harm regardless of intent or context. I am filing this so it is formally on record and reviewed by the appropriate team. Requesting priority review of the session chat log.",
                "Something in this session's chat requires formal reporting. A player sent messages that encouraged self-harm toward other players. I do not have the full context but I believe content of this nature should always be documented and reviewed rather than left to judgment. Requesting priority review of the session chat log and handling through the appropriate channel.",
                "Filing this to formally document messages sent in this session's chat that encourage self-harm toward other players. The content is in the session log. I am not in a position to assess intent or severity " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " that is why I am filing this report rather than dismissing it. Requesting priority review and handling through whatever process is appropriate for this content type.",
            },
        },
        {
            label = "Bypassing Chat Filter",
            reasons = {
                "This player has been systematically bypassing the chat filter this entire session to distribute content that would otherwise be blocked. The evasion techniques are deliberate " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " character substitutions, modified spacing, intentional misspellings " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " and the underlying content is explicit and unambiguous despite the obfuscation. Requesting manual review of the session chat log. The violations are visible once the evasion method is identified, and flagging the techniques may help update the filter.",
                "Reporting for sustained filter evasion this session. This player has been actively working around the chat filter to send content they know would be blocked " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " using character substitution, spaced letters, and other deliberate bypass methods. The intent behind the content is clear to any human reader. Requesting manual chat review. The evasion techniques and the underlying content are both documentable from the session log.",
                "This account has been evading the chat filter deliberately and consistently this session. The methods " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " modified spelling, character substitution, spaced text " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " are intentional techniques, not accidents. The underlying content being smuggled through is a clear policy violation. The filter cannot catch every variation automatically, which is exactly why this is being manually reported. Requesting chat log review and enforcement action.",
                "Documented filter bypass activity this session. Same player, repeated evasion attempts throughout the session, consistent use of obfuscation techniques to distribute blocked content. The effort invested in the bypass methods makes intent unmistakable " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " this player knows what they are trying to send would be blocked, and they are deliberately working around that. Requesting manual chat review and enforcement action.",
                "This player has spent this session evading the chat filter to send content that violates platform guidelines. The bypass techniques are deliberate and consistent " .. _CHR.EM_DASH .. " enough variation in the obfuscation to avoid automated detection, but clear enough in intent that manual review will confirm the violations immediately. Requesting session chat review, enforcement action, and flagging of the evasion patterns for filter improvement consideration.",
            },
